# MordomoOS — environment overrides (all optional; no secrets belong here)

# Move the data home (settings, db, skills, memory, routines, artifacts, logs).
# Default: the repository root.
#MORDOMO_HOME=/absolute/path/to/mordomo-home

# Provider CLIs are auto-detected on PATH; auth is handled by each CLI's own
# login flow. MordomoOS never stores provider credentials.
# If you use API-key auth for a provider, export the provider's own variable
# in your shell (never commit values):
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#OPENAI_API_KEY=
